[I] Incredibly simple helpers for testing code with exceptions

[T] Test::Fatal provides simple helpers for testing code that throws
[T] exceptions, returning the exception of a code block or undef if none was
[T] thrown, without the pitfalls of eval.

[U] https://metacpan.org/dist/Test-Fatal

